<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <title>You’ve Been Invited by “Syndicate Name” to Join a Deal on Algoralign</title>
  <style>
    /* Global styles here (same as in your provided template) */
    img {
      border: none;
      object-fit: contain;
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .img-wrapper {
      width: 160px;
      height: 68px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    table {
      border-collapse: separate;
      width: 100%;
    }
    table td {
      font-family: sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .dao_container {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto !important;
      max-width: 650px;
      padding: 10px;
      width: 650px;
    }
    .content {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 650px;
      padding: 10px;
    }
    .main {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 3px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .wrapper {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .content-block {
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      padding-top: 10px;
    }
    .footer {
      clear: both;
      margin-top: 10px;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .footer td, .footer p, .footer span, .footer a {
      color: #999999;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, h4 {
      color: #000000;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin: 0;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p, ul, ol {
      font-family: sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin: 0;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    a {
      color: #2772f0;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .dao {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .dao>tbody>tr>td {
      padding-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .dao a {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: solid 1px #2772f0;
      border-radius: 5px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      color: #2772f0;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: capitalize;
      transition: .3s ease-in-out;
    }
    .dao-primary table td {
      background-color: #2772f0;
    }
    .dao-primary a {
      background-color: #2772f0;
      border-color: #2772f0;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    hr {
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f6f6f6;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      table.body h1 {
        font-size: 28px !important;
        margin-bottom: 10px !important;
      }
      table.body p, table.body ul, table.body ol, table.body td, table.body span, table.body a {
        font-size: 16px !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <span class="preheader"></span>
  <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="body">
    <tr>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td class="dao_container">
        <div class="content">
          <table role="presentation" class="main">
            <tr>
              <td class="wrapper">
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <div class="img-wrapper">
                        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfakuzuh2/image/upload/v1689410681/logo_cvkrer.png" alt="algoralign">
                      </div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <h3>Dear {{investor_name}},</h3>
                      <p>You have been invited by {{syndicate_name}} to begin KYC for an investment deal. This is an exclusive opportunity to collaborate with other investors and support {{startup_name}} in achieving its next growth milestone.</p>
                      <h4>Deal Details:</h4>
                      <ul>
                        <li><strong>Syndicate Lead:</strong> {{syndicate_lead_name}}</li>
                        <li><strong>Startup:</strong> {{startup_name}}</li>
                        <li><strong>Minimum Investment Amount:</strong> {{currency}}{{minimum_investment}}</li>
                      </ul>
                      <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
                      <ol>
                        <li>Click the link below to review the deal details.</li>
                        <li>Complete your KYC verification (if not already done).</li>
                        <li>Confirm your participation and funding commitment.</li>
                      </ol>
                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="dao dao-primary">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="left">
                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                              <tr>
                                <td>
                                  <a href="{{review_deal_link}}" target="_blank">Review & Join Deal</a>
                                </td>
                              </tr>
                            </table>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                      <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to <a href="mailto:support@algoralign.com">support@algoralign.com</a> or contact your syndicate lead directly.</p>
                      <p>We look forward to having you onboard!</p>
                      <p>Best regards,</p>
                      <p>The Algoralign Team</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <div class="footer">
            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="content-block">
                  <span class="apple-link">Address details</span><br>
                  Don't like these emails? <a href="#">Unsubscribe</a>.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="content-block powered-by">
                  Powered by <a href="#">Algoralign</a>.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
